19.Server Components
A React Server Component (RSC) is a component whose rendering happens on the server rather than in the browser.
With a traditional client-heavy React application:
Browser
   ↓
Download JavaScript
   ↓
Execute JavaScript
   ↓
Fetch data
   ↓
Render UI

Server Components allow more work to happen on the server:
Browser
   ↓
Request page
   ↓
Server
   ├── Fetch data
   ├── Render Server Component
   └── Send result
   ↓
Browser
   ↓
Interactive client components

This can reduce the amount of JavaScript that needs to be sent to the browser.

